# ��� End-to-End DevOps Deployment of a ShortLink Application

An end-to-end DevOps project demonstrating Infrastructure as Code (IaC), Configuration Management, Containerization, Kubernetes Orchestration, CI/CD Automation, and Monitoring using modern DevOps tools.

The project provisions AWS infrastructure with Terraform, configures the server using Ansible, deploys a Flask-based ShortLink application on Kubernetes (K3s), automates deployments using Jenkins, and monitors the infrastructure using Prometheus and Grafana.

---

# ��� Architecture

```
                    +----------------------+
                    |      GitHub Repo     |
                    +----------+-----------+
                               |
                         Git Push
                               |
                               ▼
                    +----------------------+
                    | GitHub Webhook       |
                    +----------+-----------+
                               |
                               ▼
                    +----------------------+
                    | Jenkins CI/CD        |
                    +----------+-----------+
                               |
                 Build Docker Images
                               |
                               ▼
                    Push Images to Docker Hub
                               |
                               ▼
                    +----------------------+
                    | Kubernetes (K3s)     |
                    +----------+-----------+
                               |
      -------------------------------------------------
      |               |               |               |
      ▼               ▼               ▼               ▼
  Frontend        Backend        PostgreSQL        Redis

                               |
                               ▼
                    +----------------------+
                    | Prometheus           |
                    +----------+-----------+
                               |
                               ▼
                    +----------------------+
                    | Grafana Dashboard    |
                    +----------------------+
```

---

